    description: 'Type and documentation info for a symbol. Returns signatures, docs, and inferred types. Aim it with `line` + `character`, or with `symbol_name` (optionally narrowed by `symbol_kind` and `container`) for a symbol defined in the file: the result then carries `resolved_symbol` with the position that was queried. A name matching several symbols, none, or an unverifiable position fails with the candidates or the reason instead of guessing. `positions_degraded` (non-UTF-16 servers only): `"request"` means the queried position was sent unconverted, so the result may describe a different symbol and should not be trusted; `"response"` means only returned `character` offsets may be inexact.',
